  "body": "Refs #2556. The maintainer approved this plan on 2026-11-22 (decision comment on #2556).\n\n## What is wrong\nThe three tests of `air_rings_tests` take 121 s together. Each test computes the same ring plan again.\n\n## Wanted\n- Compute the plan one time with `ring_plan()` and use the result in the three tests (for example through a `OnceLock` in the test module).\n- Keep the three tests, their names and each assert.\n- Do not split the test binary.\n\n## Done when\n- The three tests are green and the PR body gives the run time before and after.\n- The `#[test]` count is the same.\n",
